 "people": [],
 "notes": [
  {
   "createdAt": 1790713826513,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "",
   "text": "I think on the papers and permits page. We should be able to upload, view, and download the document",
   "where": "Events home",
   "id": "dbxa1e7yndw8cd6ep9d8"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790713874496,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "",
   "text": "I think there should be a page for the contacts. Where we should be able to send them and store them from people",
   "where": "Events home",
   "id": "eaeuoscwmfhm1bt8vdtw"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790713927269,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "mystic-ep4",
   "text": "We need a page where we can see the venue layout and or build the layout of the event.",
   "where": "Mystic Music Ep. 4 · Overview",
   "id": "22jzt6zpb2kqoqsb15t8"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790714127102,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "mystic-ep4",
   "text": "I think the show day at a glace should me more readable. I like that I see the timeline, but I think for the average user it could be overwhelming. Plus if you're looking at it on the fly you would have to look hard.",
   "where": "Mystic Music Ep. 4 · Run of show",
   "id": "h89wyoelzj431v8ae3py"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790714206865,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "mystic-ep4",
   "text": "Also I want to be able to click on the icons on show day at a glance. I like the seamlessness of it I just cant read some of the things",
   "where": "Mystic Music Ep. 4 · Run of show",
   "id": "jorqew1afb9s9hjhs38h"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790714308610,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "mystic-ep4",
   "text": "On the Shared pages, I think we should link to the website so it can be sent to everyone involved, not just those directly involved in event planning.",
   "where": "Mystic Music Ep. 4 · Share pages",
   "id": "y41i5yqstw33iyk4p9my"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790714534469,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "5hneqtlh",
   "text": "Also we should be able to print or save each page and or have AI create a master event plan from the information we input. It probably won't need all the data, but just the high-level stuff you could go over in a meeting with a supervisor or client.",
   "where": "Cauldron Concerts · Overview",
   "id": "fcjcix5tccztxfxwgsi6"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790715059221,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "5hneqtlh",
   "text": "I like that we have pre loaded tempaltes people could use. It makes the user experices easier. I think we need to make a list of 10 of the most commoly put on events, big and small lots an money or a littile. So we can have a good amount of tenplates fro people to chosse from and enter there data in.",
   "where": "Cauldron Concerts · Run of show",
   "id": "476u9ktysdhczu3yrxcv"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790715236509,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "5hneqtlh",
   "text": "I think we need an equipment check and ad in page. So we can have interactive list that a clinte could add all the equipmnet that it takes to put on the event. Like speakers, mics, a stage ticktes a stamp. Everything involved should be able to be added and checked. We should also have the equimnet list have some pre loaded intems depened on the tempalte they choose.",
   "where": "Cauldron Concerts · Run of show",
   "id": "lm6x9jhjs1wuxf4fempo"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790715410000,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "5hneqtlh",
   "text": "I think we should have a tempalte or a version that can be used by the venues themsleves. Becasue they have a diffeert set of problems and things they need. From a event planner or orgastion planning an event. For example imagine Bells using that version or tempalte.",
   "where": "Cauldron Concerts · Run of show",
   "id": "urefxi7ijv0vlkg3yfkj"
  },
  {
   "createdAt": 1790715636411,
   "done": false,
   "eventId": "mystic-ep4",
   "text": "The deadline page is nice, but like with Jira. I want to be able to click into each deadline and edit it like a card. Plus, I am not able to read the whole description in its current view.",
   "where": "Mystic Music Ep. 4 · Deadlines",
   "id": "og3u29snb31rvglp3vp1"
  }
 ]
}